msgctxt "#30036"
msgid "Core option handling"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30037"
msgid ""
"When configuring emulation settings using the loaded .conf file's INI properties or with DOSBox commands (like \"config -set\",) there will be conflicts with the core options. This setting specifies how those conflicts should be handled.\n"
"\n"
"Lock changed options: Lock the core option to a single value. No changes will be allowed through the core options UI. The core option becomes purely informational, simply displaying the current value that was set in the .conf file or through DOSBox commands.\n"
"\n"
"Disable changed options: Disable and hide the core option. Its current value will not be changed. If the frontend doesn't support option hiding, changing the option will have no effect."
msgstr ""

