msgid "lock changed options"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30039"
msgid "disable changed options"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30040"
msgid "Always load DOSBox.conf"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30041"
msgid ""
"Always load the DOSBox.conf file if it exists in the libretro saves directory. Normally, this is not done when loading a custom conf file as content. This is the equivalent to using the \"-userconf\" option with stand-alone dosbox.\n"
"\n"
"A DOSBox.conf file based on the current dosbox settings can be generated with the \"config -wcd\" command."
msgstr ""

