msgctxt "#30205"
msgid ""
"Expanded memory (EMS) is needed or recommended by some older games. However, some games will not run at all with it enabled (Ultima 7, for example,) or will run better with it disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Mixed mode is the most compatible setting for most games that use EMS memory."
